## Project Results

The Traffic AI system successfully performs:

- Vehicle detection and counting
- Helmet detection
- No-helmet detection
- Triple-riding detection
- Wrong-direction detection
- Overspeed detection
- Number plate recognition
- Violation database storage
- REST API
- Central dashboard

## Output Evidence

Sample output images are available in the `results/` folder.

## REST API

The project provides REST API endpoints for accessing violation records and dashboard data.

